
@CC ===========================================================================

@CC = FILE NAME: (SYSTEM)HENT-FILE:SYMB

@CC ===========================================================================

@CC = DATE:    CHANGED BY:       REASON:

@CC =

@CC = 890126   TOMAS TOLLIN      LAGT NER NYTT SINTRAN K.

@CC = 890126   Peter Magnusson   Loading of TCP/IP

@CC =                              

@CC =                              

@CC ===========================================================================

@CC = INITIAL-COMMANDS EXECUTED AT A WARM START

@CC ===========================================================================


@INITIAL-COMMAND ENTER-DIRECTORY,,D-74MB-1,0

@NEXT-INITIAL-COMMAND S-E-D 1

@NEXT-INITIAL-COMMAND CONNECT SYS-OUT-1 105 R

@NEXT-INITIAL-COMMAND CLOSE 105

@NEXT-INITIAL-COMMAND BATCH

@NEXT-INITIAL-COMMAND APPEND-BATCH 1 LOAD-FILE:SYMB SYS-OUT-1


@CC ==================================================

@CC = STANDARD COMMANDS AFTER A COLD START           =

@CC =  RTENTER AND INIT-BACKROUND MUST BE EXECUTED , =

@CC =  DMAC LOADED TO SEGMENT 7 AND START 1. BATCH   =

@CC ==================================================


@RTENTER


@INITIALIZE-BACKGROUND-PROGRAMS


@RT-LOADER


REAL TIME LOADER,  SINTRAN III VSX - K

*YES
*READ-BINARY DMAC 7

CHANGING EXISTING SEGMENT? YES
*EXIT


@SIN

*@DEF-SEG-FILE Y Y 1 SEGFIL1:DATA

NO SUCH FILE NAME

*@EXIT

@BATCH

BATCH NUMBER =      1

@MAIL
NOT STARTED
*@INIT 10

*@RUN-MAIL

*@EXIT


@BATCH

BATCH NUMBER =      2

@CC ===========================================================================

@CC =                                                                         =

@CC = REMOVE SPOOLING HEADER ON PHILIPS PRINTERS ..                           =

@CC = (PUT IN CORRECT VALUES FOR SPOOLING INDEX, HEADER AND TRAILER)          =

@CC =                                                                         =

@CC ===========================================================================


@CC @SINTRAN-SERVICE

@CC @CHANGE-DATAFIELD,1,I,Y,Y,Y

@CC DFLAG/1000

@CC .

@CC @REMOVE-SPOOLING-HEADER 1 N N

@CC @EXIT


@CC ===========================================================================

@CC =                                                                         =

@CC = INITIALISE SPOOLING FILES.  I.E. ENSURE THAT THEY ARE EMPTY             =

@CC = THIS SET OF COMMANDS SHOULD BE DONE FOR EACH LINE-PRINTER OR TERMINAL   =

@CC = WITH SPOOLING, AND FOR EACH VERSION FROM 2 UPWARDS OF THOSE FILES.      =

@CC =                                                                         =

@CC ===========================================================================


@OPEN LINE-PRINTER;2 R
FILE NUMBER IS 000103
@OPEN LINE-PRINTER;3 R

NO SUCH FILE VERSION
@OPEN LINE-PRINTER;4 R

NO SUCH FILE VERSION
@OPEN LINE-PRINTER;5 R

NO SUCH FILE VERSION
@OPEN LINE-PRINTER;6 R

NO SUCH FILE VERSION
@OPEN LINE-PRINTER;7 R

NO SUCH FILE VERSION
@OPEN LINE-PRINTER;8 R

NO SUCH FILE VERSION
@OPEN LINE-PRINTER;9 R

NO SUCH FILE VERSION
@OPEN LINE-PRINTER;10 R

NO SUCH FILE VERSION
@CLOSE -1

@CC ====================================

@CC == DUMPING OF ACCOUNTING SYSTEM   ==

@CC ====================================


@CC @MODE ACCRT-LOAD:MODE,,,


@CC ===========================================

@CC = DUMPING OF BACKUP-SYSTEM AND  SERVER    =

@CC ===========================================


@MODE (UTILITY)BACKUP-LOAD-H:MODE,,,,

@CC ===================================================================

@CC Mode job to load the forground part of the BACKUP-SYSTEM to segment

@CC called DMASEG. The module concists of the DMA-server plus some

@CC specific routines defined by the BACKUP-SYSTEM.

@CC The mode-job must be run from SYSTEM.

@CC ==================================================================

@CC

@CC          Abort the DMA-server and unfix the DMASEG:

@CC

@abort dmasl

ILLEGAL PARAMETER

@abort dmafr

ILLEGAL PARAMETER

@abort dmato

ILLEGAL PARAMETER

@abort dmasrv

ILLEGAL PARAMETER

@unfix dmaseg

ILLEGAL SEGMENT NAME

@CC          Wait for the RT-loader to become available:

@schedule 503b

@CC          Load the DMA-server:

@rt-loader


REAL TIME LOADER,  SINTRAN III VSX - K

*clear-segment,dmaseg

SEGMENT NAME NOT DEFINED
*yes
*delete-seg-name,dmaseg,,

SEGMENT NAME NOT DEFINED
*set-seg-file 0
*new-segment,dmaseg,2,,,,,
NEW SEGMENT NO:    65
*read-progfile (UTILITY)BACKUP-SERV-H,dmaseg,,,
*end-load
*declare-program dmasrv,,
*declare-program dmafr,,
*declare-program dmato,,
*declare-program dmasl,,
*change-rt-description dmasrv,62,dmaseg,,0,2,1,,,,
*change-rt-description dmafr,100,dmaseg,,1,2,1,,,,
*change-rt-description dmato,100,dmaseg,,2,2,1,,,,
*change-rt-description dmasl,100,dmaseg,,3,2,1,,,,
*exit

@rtoff dmafr

@rtoff dmato

@rtoff dmasl

@CC @rt dmasrv

@CC

@CC          Starting of the server should be done in the

@CC          LOAD-MODE:MODE file, or manually.

@CC          Make sure that XMSG is started before attempt

@CC          to start the server.


@DUMP-PROGRAM-REENTRANT BACKUP-SYSTEM-H (UTILITY)BACKUP-H06


